            "name": "Mercedes Kwiatkowski",
            "startSeconds": 2237,
            "endSeconds": 2413,
            "summary": "As a child psychiatrist and district parent, she supported proactive phone restrictions, cited evidence that phone bans improve grades, engagement, and reduce the achievement gap, and noted that phones can actually compromise safety during emergencies."
